WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.876
I'm dating Izzie.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:06.297
What, y-y-your friend Izzie?

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:08.008
Mm-hmm.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.303
Oh.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.055
Oh?

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:16.099
Is that a good or a bad "oh"?

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.892
I don't know what kind of damn "oh" it is.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:18.852
Okay.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.395
♪ Pick right up ♪

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.024
♪ Where we left off… ♪

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:26.693
Does Mom know?

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.113
Yeah, I think she knew before I did.

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:32.490
Sam?

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.242
Yes.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.620
♪ To old routines… ♪

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.956
So I'm last?

00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:43.585
I just didn't know how to--
You know, it's--

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:44.669
It's okay.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.380
♪ Oh, it's so easy… ♪

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:50.008
-I think I was just afraid that you'd--
-Afraid that I'd what?

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:51.092
I don't know.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:52.844
See me differently?

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:54.637
I don't know.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.640
I don't.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.434
What?

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.811
See you differently.

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:05.565
You're still a pain in the ass.

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:06.733
[chuckles]

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:11.362
♪ We're streams in a river
And the river will run…&nbsp;♪

00:01:11.446 --> 00:01:12.363
Evan know?

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:15.366
Yeah.

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:19.621
-What about the mailman? You tell him too?
-Months ago.

